  "details": "Reproducability: \nAs far as I know, only confirmed on the blueprintID of JapanStreet, in other case cannot happen.\nAlso, because people visit this world frequently, I haven't been able to figure out this condition (during investigation, this world become unavailable...).\n\nProcedure of reproduce:\nSome modify on the world project and try to upload the world, Upload is successful on the Unity, but it's makes world size become 0B and it makes unable to join this world. \n\nMitigation:\nre upload this world makes sometimes solve this issue.",
